# The preset allowlist of the node bundle (docs/BUNDLE.md): the actions the
# ctrl-exec agent of a starter node may run, and nothing else. One per line:
#   name [key=value ...]     key=value is a scripts.conf option (profile, input)
# name is a file under actions/ in the bundle. These are the scripts of the
# pinned images (nix/modules/hps-ctrl-exec.nix, and nagios-check of
# nix/modules/hps-monitor.nix, same profile, no input) plus bundle-refresh; a test
# keeps the two lists the same until the pinned images are retired (plan step 7).
